ource":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/kiwi#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:fc83436c2f4634d749","definition":"To polish (boots) with black shoe polish.","example":"Johari Salleh: Ya, ya. Better not waste time. Must prepare, tomorrow morning got inspection.\nTeo Ah Beng: Ya lah, must kiwi the boots. Can borrow [lend] me your cloth?\nKrishnamoorthy: Ya, no problem. You better kiwi quickly. 11 pm lights off. […]","pos":"verb","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"Singapore, slang","register":"Singapore, slang","wordFamily":["common kiwi","great spotted kiwi","hardy kiwi","kiwi berry","kiwirita","kiwitini","little spotted kiwi","North Island brown kiwi","Okarito brown kiwi","Okarito kiwi","southern brown kiwi"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/kiwi#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:0877f411fbf2de22ae","definition":"A New Zealander.","example":"A blokart (say blow-cart) plays to the penchant that Kiwis and Aussies have for pushing the limits in search of fun. It’s a ground-hugging, tricyclelike combination of aluminum tubing and rubber wheels with a steering wheel and a sail.","pos":"noun","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"informal","register":"informal","wordFamily":["common kiwi","great spotted kiwi","hardy kiwi","kiwi berry","kiwirita","kiwitini","little spotted kiwi","North Island brown kiwi","Okarito brown kiwi","Okarito kiwi","southern brown kiwi"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Kiwi#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:cebe3ddda486d46543","definition":"Of or from New Zealand.","example":"The two Kiwi brothers who spent time in a Thailand prison after allegedly wrestling an officer to